culator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them. In 2025 the middle sat at 52% of normal for February to March and 164% for August to September. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 13% on the middle. Grid 22918 had its driest year in 1956 at 46%.</p>"}
